  "result": "I fixed the board showing archived issues. I haven't run the test suite or the app, so the change is untested.\n\nThe cause was in `listBoardColumns` in `src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts`, which builds the board's columns. It filtered only by organization and project, so archived issues came back as cards. The issue list, counts and exports all go through code that already filters archived rows.\n\nI added the same live-rows-only filter the other queries in that file use (`livePredicate(issues.archivedAt, {})`).",
